[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17760.07, "timestamp": "04:56:00", "text": "就像我这种内容形式，对吧，呃，如果那样的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17762.55, "timestamp": "04:56:02", "text": "那么，即使是寿司，也是可以实现的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17764.55, "timestamp": "04:56:04", "text": "龙正在做的这件事也可以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.788, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "未来作为一名 YouTuber 可以实现的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17769.91, "timestamp": "04:56:09", "text": "不，所以我就想，是的，我要走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17772.15, "timestamp": "04:56:12", "text": "沿着这条路，我想学习如何……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17774.628, "timestamp": "04:56:14", "text": "像寿司龙那样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17778.07, "timestamp": "04:56:18", "text": "创新方向之类的，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17780.868, "timestamp": "04:56:20", "text": "就是这件事让我感觉好多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17784.628, "timestamp": "04:56:24", "text": "开始认真起来，就像我想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17787.75, "timestamp": "04:56:27", "text": "转型成为VTuber，专攻运动型角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17791.19, "timestamp": "04:56:31", "text": "而不仅仅是理想情况下进行流媒体播放和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17792.91, "timestamp": "04:56:32", "text": "东西和没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17795.43, "timestamp": "04:56:35", "text": "品牌形象之类的东西。当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17798.23, "timestamp": "04:56:38", "text": "我现在刚设计了一个logo，这次我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.03, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "意识到是的，我可以拥有整张脸"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17804.47, "timestamp": "04:56:44", "text": "以及角色设计故事背景"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17807.91, "timestamp": "04:56:47", "text": "很多东西和日常想法都被用到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17809.91, "timestamp": "04:56:49", "text": "过来什么的，我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17811.83, "timestamp": "04:56:51", "text": "是的，我打算首次亮相。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17815.11, "timestamp": "04:56:55", "text": "一切都发生了，但那件事从未发生过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17817.27, "timestamp": "04:56:57", "text": "哦"}]